# Hand-traced Pantheon scenario (ticket 06): the Gate, Hades, Enki and Zeus.
# Script: P1 activates the Gate (taking Aphrodite) and Enki, P2 Hades (the best blue card in the discard pile) and Zeus;
# a player holding a Mythology token builds its Grand Temple (free). Every other take-card turn discards the first accessible card (2 coins: nobody builds a yellow card). Reveals come from RandomChanceSource(7); other decisions take the first legal Move.
# The working is in PantheonScenarioTests.Gate_hades_enki_zeus.
